      <title>Sigabo[直播]</title>
      <desc>The series explores the stark contrast in the lives of two individuals: Gabo (Martin), a spunky, street-smart man from a vibrant, humble community, and Samantha (Montes), a tough, fearless law enforcer from a highly affluent and privileged background. It blends action, romance, and comedy as their paths cross and their different worlds collide.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703005500 +0800" stop="20260703013500 +0800" channel="276">
      <title>Blood Vs. Duty[直播]</title>
      <desc>Two brothers separated in a maritime tragedy grow up on opposite sides of the law - one a dedicated Intelligence Officer, the other fiercely protective of the Tausug family that raised him. When a corruption case pits them against each other, their long-buried secret threatens to ignite a war between blood and loyalty.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703013500 +0800" stop="20260703021500 +0800" channel="276">
      <title>The Alibi[直播]</title>
      <desc>Vincent, an heir to a news empire, gets accused of killing his rival, Walter. To protect his reputation, he hires Stella, an escort with her own haunted past, to pose as his alibi. What begins as a transactional arrangement soon becomes dangerously real as their shared wounds and ambitions draw them together. But when they uncover the truth, the two are compelled to confront their true feelings.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703021500 +0800" stop="20260703025000 +0800" channel="276">
      <title>Incognito</title>
      <desc>Private Military Contractors (PMCs) engage in high-stakes tasks daily, with many skilled Filipino soldiers involved. Incognito follows ex-soldiers on covert missions, blending intense action with themes of honor, love, and redemption.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703025000 +0800" stop="20260703032500 +0800" channel="276">
      <title>The Iron Heart</title>
      <desc>The Iron Heart follows Apollo Adelantar, an undercover operative with a traumatic past who is assigned to infiltrate a powerful crime syndicate. As he goes deeper into his dangerous mission, Apollo is forced to confront painful truths about his identity, loyalty, and family-especially when trusted allies turn into enemies. Fueled by vengeance, justice, and his desire to protect the innocent, Apollo and his companions face relentless trials that test not only their strength but also their moral convictions.</desc>
    </programme>
