    <programme start="20260703000200 +0800" stop="20260703002900 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Littoral 第13集 -Azou Riding The Waves</title>
      <desc>In 2022, filmmaker Lisa Diaz chose young Azou to star in her feature film &amp;apos;&amp;apos;Libre Garance!&amp;apos;&amp;apos;. Today, Azou is 15 and starting a new chapter in life as she enters tenth grade at the certified surf training center in Pont-l&amp;apos;Abbe.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703002900 +0800" stop="20260703014300 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Meteo A La Carte 第119集</title>
      <desc>An interactive programme that&amp;apos;s as fun as it is informative and reactive to the meteorological events of the moment. Reports from the regions and special subjects in the studio offer an easy way to better understand the impact weather has on health, nature, history and everyday life.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703014300 +0800" stop="20260703015600 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>L&amp;apos;art ET La Matiere 第9季第24集 -How Was The Whalebone Corset Born?</title>
      <desc>The history of the whalebone corset and the Baccarat crystal works, an emblematic town of pure crystal since 1764.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703015600 +0800" stop="20260703022600 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Les Ambassadeurs 第14集 -Ellezelles, Land Of Hills</title>
      <desc>Nathalie Guirma heads to Ellezelles, between Ath and Lessines, in the heart of the Land of Hills. The region lives up to its name, as these valleys truly define the landscape and offer a setting full of charm.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703022600 +0800" stop="20260703025500 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Les Ambassadeurs 第15集 -Cycling Itinerary</title>
      <desc>More and more tourists are looking for cycling, kayaking or horseback itineraries lasting one or several days. In the Ourthe-Vesdre-Ambleve region, in the province of Liege, Nathalie tries out a formula combining accommodation, heritage promotion and local products. All by bike!</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703025500 +0800" stop="20260703032200 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Version Francaise 第11季第1集 -Herve Van Der Straeten/Alison Thirion</title>
      <desc>In the heart of the Marais district in Paris, the National Archives Museum hosts works dating back several centuries. French designer and architect Herve Van der Straeten opens the doors to his workshop. Style by Alessandro Michele for Valentino. We meet up with ceramic artist Alison Thirion.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703032200 +0800" stop="20260703034700 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Les Saisons De Pique-Assiette 第15季第5集 -Provencal Daube</title>
      <desc>Annick Jeanmairet and Brigitte Rosset offer you a recipe for Provencal daube. Discovery of the day: white wine tart.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703034700 +0800" stop="20260703041400 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Passe-Moi Les Jumelles 第12季第10集 -The Flavour Of The Middle Ages</title>
      <desc>For Pierre Chatelain, preparing recipes with mediaeval flavour is a sacred quest that brings pure happiness. Using produce that is authentic, local and seasonal he sets out to surprise our palate with unknown flavours that take us back to the world of yesteryear.</desc>
    </programme>
