      <title>Flavie En France 第89集 -Chalons-En-Champagne (4)</title>
      <desc>Flavie Flament visits Chalons-en-Champagne, meeting local residents at the market. Today, she focuses on a school that promotes circus arts and visits Chateau Perrier.</desc>
