      <desc>Established in Year 2004, Creation TV has produced a lot of quality programs and delivers the message of happy-life Joy with God to families via our television broadcast. Programs are edited and produced as the tools for evangelists and life education.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260703150000 +0800" stop="20260703153000 +0800" channel="220">
      <title>喜乐婆婆会客室</title>
      <desc>主持小金子乔妈,人称「喜乐婆婆」,一生经历操练出一套喜乐心得,她更请来一众嘉宾好友,分享人生中大小风浪,靠着的是同出一辙的喜乐秘诀,在节目中娓娓道出那份属天的快乐。</desc>
    </programme>
