      <title>Version Francaise 第11季第12集 -Maison Des Canuts/Sarah Valente/Thibaut Thierry</title>
      <desc>The Maison des Canuts traces the long tradition of Lyon&amp;apos;s gold, silver and silk weavers. Each creation by visual artist Sarah Valente sounds like a call from the forest. Zomer is turning fashion upside down. In Brittany, craftsman Thibaut Thierry works paper with seaweed.</desc>
