      <title>Echappees Belles 第19季第21集 -A Winter In The Pyrenees</title>
      <desc>From the green of the Pyrenees to the blue of the Mediterranean, the Pyrenees-Orientales offer an impressive diversity of landscapes. This contrast makes the department an ideal holiday destination, where you can enjoy winter sports in the morning and the sun in the afternoon, while discovering Catalan culture, its gastronomy and its architecture. Jerome Pitorin begins his journey in the resort of Les Angles with Cecile Hernandez, Paralympic snowboarding champion.</desc>
